{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is approached, take and move it to destination; else, scan and move to next location. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = ScanObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextLocation    />   <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />      <Condition ID = IsDestinationReached    />      <SubTree ID = MobileRobotTask    />\"",
